            <ArticleTitle>Patterning Multicolored Microdisk Laser Arrays of Cesium Lead Halide Perovskite.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/adma.201604510</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A polydimethylsiloxane cylindrical-hole-template-confined solution-growth method is developed to fabricate densely packed CsPbCl3-x Br x microdisk laser arrays. Furthermore, a strategy to integrate multicolored microdisk laser (MDL) arrays is demonstrated that simultaneously lase in the deep blue, blue, cyan, and green by means of gas-phase replacement of Cl by Br from initial CsPbCl3 MDLs in HBr vapor.</AbstractText>
